    "Name": "Laurens SPAAG",
    "Details": "Fulfilling a desperate need for mobile anti aircraft assets, the Laurens was the SLDFs standard anti aircraft platform following its introduction in 2754. A 100 ton tank, the Laurens mounted a pair of AC/2s and UAC/5s in its turret with an LB-10X for backup at closer ranges. The manufacturing line for the tank was destroyed in 2769, dooming it to a long and slow decline to extinction during the Succession Wars.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       320     50\n<b>Left</b>         250     50\n<b>Right</b>       250     50\n<b>Rear</b>        200     50\n<b>Turret</b>      295     50\n\n<b>Total</b>      1315    250</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Anti Air Targeting</color>",
    "Icon": "Partisan"
  },
